# Support doubles and redoubles: we open, partner responds one of a
# major, RHO comes in. 21GF-DEFAULT plays them, with `through` unset
# (two of partner's major).
card    21GF-DEFAULT
dealer  S
vul     None

# seat hand                 | auction          | expect | why
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C P 1H 1S       | X      | exactly three hearts, 14 HCP: support double
S AK3.Q842.J3.KJ65          | 1C P 1H 1S       | 2H     | four hearts: the raise
S T72.AKQ.2.AQ8543          | 1C P 1H 1S       | X      | three hearts and six clubs: support first, as BBA
S KJ3.7.AQ852.KJ52          | 1D P 1S 2H       | X      | 2H is below two spades
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C P 1H 2S       | P      | 2S is above two hearts: no support double
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C P 1H X        | XX     | support redouble over their double
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C 1D 1H 2D      | X      | LHO overcalled and RHO raised: still support
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C X 1H 1S       | X      | after their takeout double too
S AK3.Q8.AJ3.KJ652          | 1C X 1H 1S       | 2NT    | 18 balanced, two hearts: not the 18+ double here
S AK3.Q8.AJ.KJ6532          | 1C X 1H 1S       | 2S     | 18 unbalanced with no three hearts: cue bid

# Responder after the double, LHO passing.
N 874.KJ642.95.K82          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 2H     | five hearts, 8 points: the eight-card fit
N 874.KJ642.Q5.K82          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 3H     | five hearts, 10 points: invites
N A74.KJ642.Q5.K82          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 4H     | five hearts, 13 HCP: game
N KJ4.QT64.Q53.J82          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 1NT    | four hearts, 9 balanced with a spade stopper
N K84.KJ64.A53.Q82          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 3NT    | four hearts, 13 balanced with a spade stopper
N 84.KJ64.Q53.K842          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 2C     | four hearts and four clubs, 9: raise the minor
N 874.KJ64.AQ5.A82          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 2S     | four hearts, 14, no spade stopper: cue bid
N 874.KJ64.Q53.K82          | 1C P 1H 1S X P   | 2H     | nothing better: the 4-3 fit at the two level
N T832.A96.92.AKJ2          | 1D P 1S 2C X P   | P      | four spades and AKJ2 in their clubs: penalty

# After the redouble, and when they bid again.
N 874.KJ64.Q53.K82          | 1C P 1H X XX P   | P      | play one heart redoubled
N 874.KJ642.Q5.K82          | 1C P 1H 1S X 2S  | 3H     | five hearts: compete in the eight-card fit
N 874.KJ64.Q53.K82          | 1C P 1H 1S X 2S  | P      | four hearts and a minimum: leave it

# Opener's next call.
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C P 1H 1S X P 2S P | 3NT | a spade stopper for the cue bid
S 983.AQ4.K3.AKJ52          | 1C P 1H 1S X P 2S P | 4H  | no spade stopper: the 4-3 game
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C P 1H 1S X P 2H P | P   | a minimum opposite the sign-off

# A card that plays them through 3♣.
card    21GF-DEFAULT doubles.support.through=3♣
S A5.KJ3.AQ852.J52          | 1D P 1H 3C       | X      | 3C is within the card's through
S A5.KJ3.AQ852.J52          | 1D P 1H 3D       | !X     | 3D is above it

# Basic-Bridge does not play them.
card    Basic-Bridge
S AK3.Q84.J3.KJ652          | 1C P 1H 1S       | P      | three hearts: no support double on this card
S AK3.Q8.AJ3.KJ652          | 1C X 1H 1S       | X      | the 18+ double where support doubles are off
